<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Casa Autrey as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Casa Autrey as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said it initiated coverage of Grupo Casa Autrey SA with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- expects company to continue expansion plans as consumer demand in Mexico recovers. Sees company benefiting from growth in private consumption;  price increases from pharmaceuticals products above inflation; and stabilization of growth margins with addition of high-margin products.</p>
<p>-- also cited expectation of increased sales volume, with incorporation of new distribution channels.</p>
<p>-- ADRs fell 1/8 to 22-5/8.</p>
</text>
